sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend
  participant API as Supabase REST

  U->>F: Click product
  F->>API: GET /rest/v1/products?id=eq.<id>&select=*,variants(*)
  API-->>F: product + variants
  F-->>U: render product detail
  U->>F: Click Add to Cart
  F->>API: (if using DB cart) POST /rest/v1/cart {user_id, product, qty}
  API-->>F: cart row created
  F-->>U: show cart updated
